An analysis file contained 25 tool extensions which is more than our limit of 20. The upload was rejected.

If you've configured CodeQL to run additional queries, please ensure you are following the guidance at https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/code-scanning/automatically-scanning-your-code-for-vulnerabilities-and-errors/customizing-code-scanning#running-additional-queries, in particular avoiding referencing queries directly from `github/codeql`.

[Learn more about limits in SARIF uploads](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/code-scanning/integrating-with-code-scanning/sarif-support-for-code-scanning#validating-your-sarif-file).